      "sequence_position": 11,
      "problem": "Given that $f(x)=\\frac{1}{4}\\operatorname{tan}⁡x,$ which of the following shows the curve $y=f(x)?$",
      "worked_solution": "To plot the given curve, we follow these steps:\n\n- Start with the graph of $y=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$\n\n- Then, stretch it parallel to the $y$-axis by a stretch factor of $\\frac{1}{4}.$\n\nThe resulting graph is shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14255908/assets/7e12d63d1b3fc0ca89d48613eba7594767a1fe96d71ca1d7cb7bfedfe5fece51.png)",
